  "releaseNotes": "Microsoft.Fabric.Api SDK Release Notes [2.0.0]\n- Introducing CosmosDBDatabase APIs.\n- Introducing NlToKql public API endpoint.\n- Addition of \"recursive\" and \"rootFolderId\" query parameters to List APIs.\n- Introducing Ontology APIs.\n- Introducing EventSchemaSet APIs.\n- Removed Beta APIs.\n- Aligned all operation Ids into a unified format.\n- Aligned all Id type properties to the uuid format.\n- Updated principal object model to use type as a descriminator for different principal types.\n- Removed backwards compatibility support for depricated job scheduling methods.",
